OL,3,GNEWSA'We can't get straw': thatchers
OL,4,Aunder pressure
OL,5,
OL,6,FThatchers say they're facing a growing
OL,7,Fshortage of straw which is putting them
OL,8,Fout of work for months at a time.
OL,10,FThe traditional trade is responsible
OL,11,Ffor maintaining some of Oxfordshire's
OL,12,Fmost recognisable homes but thatcher's
OL,13,Fsay finding enough suitable material is
OL,14,Fbecoming increasingly difficult.
OL,16,FChris Pike from Thame Thatch said the
OL,17,Flack of straw is having a huge impact
OL,18,Fon not just his work but also the homes
OL,19,Fwaiting to be thatched: "We're just
OL,20,Finto a new harvest but by April we'll
OL,21,Frun out of straw again."
OL,23,APub: 09-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
