OL,3,GNEWSA'We can't get straw': thatchers
OL,4,Aunder pressure
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe government advisory body Historic
OL,7,FEngland said they understood the
OL,8,Fchallenges and had been "engaging
OL,9,Fclosely with the sector on these issues
OL,10,Fover recent years".
